# Keep the build artifacts byte-exact across platforms.
#
# `lib/*.js` is not ordinary source: it is a `__ModuleLoader__` factory wrapper
# whose banner/footer brace shape is part of the DSH client-loader contract.
# A checkout that rewrites its line endings produces a file that differs from
# what was built and tested, so pin these to LF and mark them binary-ish.
lib/*.js text eol=lf
lib/*.d.ts text eol=lf

# Source and docs: normalize to LF so a Windows contributor and a Linux CI
# produce the same commit.
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
